			<staticText>
				<reportElement mode="Opaque" x="160" y="349" width="470" height="22" backcolor="#C4C1C0" uuid="b1bf36ed-7e0c-4bc2-aaf7-a47aa80c4190">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<box>
					<topPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
					<leftPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
					<bottomPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
					<rightPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
				</box>
				<textElement>
					<font isBold="true"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[ A message alert is popped up on system if there is a match against the list.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement mode="Opaque" x="160" y="806" width="470" height="42" backcolor="#C4C1C0" uuid="9ad29051-41a0-4d68-8b21-fbe6132fccf8"/>
				<box>
					<topPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
					<leftPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
					<bottomPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
					<rightPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
				</box>
				<textElement>
					<font isBold="true"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[We consolidate all the Government Gazettes, ICAC letters, FIU letters and MRA letters into one 'Blacklist for Mauritian Citizens'.]]></text>
			</staticText>
			<staticText>
				<reportElement mode="Opaque" x="160" y="1290" width="470" height="97" backcolor="#C4C1C0" uuid="a5b4499b-7203-4c26-b6c5-2dcc78a39939">
					<property name="com.jaspersoft.studio.unit.height" value="px"/>
				</reportElement>
				<box>
					<topPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
					<leftPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
					<bottomPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
					<rightPen lineWidth="1.0" lineStyle="Solid" lineColor="#000000"/>
				</box>
				<textElement>
					<font isBold="true"/>
				</textElement>
				<text><![CDATA[For SN 22, we maintain our 'Blacklist for Mauritian Citizens' on Finacle and we will implement an AML software to cater for the UN listing.
Currently,this is done.
(1) as and when we received a listing from the Bank or FIU, or
(2) every first working day of the month a consolidated list from the website of the UNSC is downloaded and the data is matched against our customer database. The result is sent to the Bank and to the National Sanctions Secretariat through an e-mail in both cases.]]></text>
			</staticText>
